DOWNFALL-LOW_PROFILE.description:
Gain {CalculationBase:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].
Gains {CalculationExtra:diff()} additional [gold]Block[/gold] for each of your Debuffs.{InCombat:
(Gains {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].)|}

DOWNFALL-GRUDGE.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} more for ALL your [gold]Curse[/gold] cards.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-UNLEASH.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} more for each other card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-THE_TOWER.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} more for each card created this combat.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-GREMLIN_TOSS.description:
Gain {DownfallTempHpPower:diff()} [gold]Temp HP[/gold].
Deal damage equal to your current [gold]Block[/gold] and [gold]Temp HP[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-SECOND_VOLLEY.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Add {IfUpgraded:show:an Upgraded |a }[gold]Shiv[/gold] to your [gold]Hand[/gold] for each card played this turn, until your [gold]Hand[/gold] is full.{InCombat:
({CalculatedCards:diff()} {CalculatedCards:plural:card|cards} played.)|}

DOWNFALL-CHAMP_PERFECTED_STRIKE.descript:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} additional damage for ALL your "Strike" cards.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-SHIELD_THROW.description:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Block[/gold] {Repeat:diff()} times.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}
If not in [gold]Defensive Stance[/gold], you cannot gain [gold]Block[/gold] from cards next turn.

DOWNFALL-COMBO_STRING.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage for each [gold]Offclass[/gold] card played this turn.{InCombat:
({Hits:diff()} {Hits:plural:hit|hits}.)|}
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.

DOWNFALL-NIBBLE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Add a [gold]Lick[/gold] to your [gold]Hand[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
Draw 1 card.|}

DOWNFALL-TONGUE_LASH.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} additional damage for each Exhausted "Lick" card.{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-OVEREXERT.description:
Gain {PotencyPower:diff()} [gold]Potency[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]Command[/gold] twice.|}
{LoseSlimesPower:diff()} turns from now, [gold]Absorb[/gold] all Slimes.

DOWNFALL-CRYSTAL_BEAM.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
