(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-CLONE.description:
Choose a card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].
Place a copy of that card into [gold]Stasis[/gold].{IfUpgraded:show:
[gold]Accelerate[/gold].|}

DOWNFALL-REFRACTED_BEAM.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage {Repeat:diff()} times.
