Triggers socketed [gold]Gems[/gold] an extra time per upgrade.{SocketText}

DOWNFALL-BODY_CRASH.description:
Gain {Block:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Block[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-HEAT_CRUSH.description:
Deal {CalculationBase:diff()} damage.
Damage is increased by the enemy's [gold]Soulburn[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deals {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.)|}

DOWNFALL-UNLEASH_SPIRITS.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy.
